# Design (chrome only)

Tokens live in `src/styles/tokens.css`. Specimens ignore these.

| Token | Value | Use |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `--ink` | `#12141A` | Page ground |
| `--panel` | `#1B1E26` | Plate ground |
| `--rule` | `#2C313C` | Hairlines |
| `--pewter` | `#767E8C` | Captions / disabled |
| `--chalk` | `#E6E8EC` | Primary text |
| `--verdigris` | `#4E9E8F` | Interactive only |

## Type

- Display: Archivo Variable, stretch ~125%, weight 700, `-0.02em`
- Body: Inter Tight
- Utility: JetBrains Mono — refs/tags uppercase, `0.08em` tracking, one step smaller than adjacent body

## Restraint

- Hairlines: `1px solid var(--rule)` — no shadows on chrome
- `border-radius: 2px` on `.plate` only; `0` elsewhere
- Hover: rule-colour shift + focus ring only — chrome does not move
- One accent, one use per viewport
